Z||000000||poupas||06-08-2001||03:25 AM||||I just noticed, this site, fiero.nl, in reference to the Netherlands, would that be Holland? In my previous thread, I also noticed somone saying, better hurry up, Cliff will be getting up soon. As in 6 hours ahead. Wake up 6 hours later. hmmmm!<BR>   Well, as it happens, I was in Amsterdam for their queens birthday this year. On the second day I was there I was walking down a road and saw a Fiero GT. I was(first I was completely shocked) tempted to go say 'What the hell', but I passed, a little hung over. Cliff, do you know this person? Or is it you? If you live in Holland or Amsterdam, you heard about queensday, teargas at central station. I smelled some of that. Beautiful country.<BR>    Do you know of this red GT? Is there only one Fiero in Holland?<BR>    If you say yes this is the most bizarre 4 days on a forum ever!!<BR>||||reg||1
